# No dev toolbar in commits

When committing or pushing (especially to `demo1`), **never include** dev-only UI unless the user explicitly asks for it.

Exclude from staging and commits:

- `src/fitness/DevOnboardingToolbar.tsx`
- `src/fitness/devPreviewOnboarding.ts`
- Any change whose primary purpose is exposing, enabling, or modifying the floating dev onboarding button / "Open onboarding" toolbar, or the Sunday check-in dev preview button

Do not wait for the user to repeat "don't push dev button" — apply this by default on every commit and push.

If dev toolbar files are mixed with other work, stage only the non-dev files.
